OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy today with outbreaks of
OL,6,Frain and drizzle across the region
OL,7,Ftoday with brisk winds. Cloud
OL,8,Fthickening at times to bring fog
OL,9,Faround hills and northern coasts.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FStaying cloudy and damp
OL,12,Fthrough this evening, but gradually
OL,13,Fturning drier after midnight with
OL,14,Fvariable cloud and clear spells
OL,15,Fdeveloping. Winds easing.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSunday:FA drier and brighter day with
OL,18,Flight winds. Feeling pleasant in the
OL,19,Fsunny spells. Increasing sunny spells
OL,20,Finto the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
